{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测通过 Elastic Endpoint 响应控制台拉起的 Shell。对应需求：响应通道被滥用或未授权远程执行。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux经Elastic Endpoint控制台执行Shell","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nEndpoint 响应控制台在 Linux 上执行了 Shell。\n\n### 为何重要\n合法远程处置通道一旦被劫持可变成任意命令执行。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 对照控制台审计：操作者、工单、命令原文。\n2. 还原进程树与是否提权。\n3. 未授权则撤账号/API Key 并隔离主机。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"ef35b103-7fca-4af4-879d-a7e73c918659","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络事件）。\n2. 确认 `logs-endpoint.events.process*` 有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 命令与控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 响应通道滥用"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"start\") and\nprocess.parent.executable == \"/opt/Elastic/Endpoint/elastic-endpoint\" and\nprocess.name in (\"bash\", \"dash\", \"sh\", \"tcsh\", \"csh\", \"zsh\", \"ksh\", \"fish\") and\nprocess.args in (\"-c\", \"-cl\", \"-lc\", \"--command\")\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Command and Control","id":"TA0011","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"},"technique":[{"name":"Remote Access Tools","id":"T1219","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1219/"}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Defense Evasion","id":"TA0005","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/"}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"name":"Execution","id":"TA0002","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"name":"Unix Shell","id":"T1059.004","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]}]}],"false_positives":["已登记的应急处置或排查命令"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
